---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_investor: caller is investor with position
    q_check_investor --> q_check_excess: hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_check_investor --> q_revert_claimed: hasClaimedExcess == true
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_check_excess --> q_verify_sig: investedCapital > acceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_no_excess: no excess capital
    q_revert_no_excess --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_verify_sig --> q_calc_excess: verify reduced allocation signature
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_calc_excess --> q_transfer: excessAmount = investedCapital - acceptedAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update: transfer excessAmount of bidToken to investor
    q_update --> [*]: hasClaimedExcess = true, emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_calc_excess
        INV-001: excess = investedCapital - acceptedAmount (never negative)
        INV-002: hasClaimedExcess prevents double-claim
        INV-003: signature must reflect updated/reduced allocation terms
    end note
